Scoring uses only final-layer MSE and a `max(0.1, C / B)` multiplier, so spending more FLOPs can help until about 10% of budget and then directly trades off against MSE. The existing `_BUDGET_FRACTION` is intentionally above that floor, so the score suggests extra samples are still buying accuracy.
